If you found this useful, please subscribe to J D Science,

94
00:04:21.688 --> 00:04:25.414
and visit j d science dot co dot u k for

95
00:04:25.496 --> 00:04:29.362
more explanations, worksheets and T-Level Chemistry

96
00:04:29.420 --> 00:04:30.012
lessons.
